-3. Calculate the Z-resolution by scaling the Y-target by the ratio of the scene's Z-size to Y-size, rounding up to the nearest integer:
-   $$N_z = \lceil \frac{\text{voxels\_on\_y}}{size.y} \times size.z \rceil$$
